DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261116
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
SUMMARY:On duty: Bins
DESCRIPTION:Nov 2 – Nov 15: Take bins out at 7pm the evening before picku
 p\, bring them back at 7pm on pickup day. Keep the garbage area clean: no 
 bags on the ground\, lids closed\, never leave bags beside a full bin.\n\n
 Can't do it? Swap with another unit and write it on the calendar in the en
 trance.\nhttps://studiozenkai.com/2675poirier
END:VEVENT
